  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida genomf&#xf6;r en publik informationskampanj med MR som &quot;ing&#xe5;ngs&#xe4;mne&quot; under h&#xf6;sten 1998. TV-spot, radioreklam, annonser, intensifierad PR- verksamhet, websatsning samt anv&#xe4;ndande av MR som tungt &#xe4;mne i v&#xe5;r l&#xf6;pande kommunikation ing&#xe5;r som viktiga delar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will launch a public campaign during the autumn of 1998 where Human Rights will be the main subject. A television spot, radio commersials, advertisements, intensified PR, publication on our web site and the use of Human Rights as a main subject in all Sidas information will be important parts of the campaign.</narrative>
